  "title": "Cloud responsibility matrix",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Cloud responsibility matrix</h2><p>Assign control responsibilities and identify a missing dependency in an outsourced payroll system.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m1-tbs1-f1\">Application service model</label><select id=\"isc-m1-tbs1-f1\"><option value=\"SaaS\">SaaS</option><option value=\"A paper archive\">A paper archive</option><option value=\"A guaranteed zero-risk system\">A guaranteed zero-risk system</option><option value=\"Only a local operating system\">Only a local operating system</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m1-tbs1-f2\">Owner of customer role approvals</label><select id=\"isc-m1-tbs1-f2\"><option value=\"The customer\">The customer</option><option value=\"No responsible party\">No responsible party</option><option value=\"Only payroll employees\">Only payroll employees</option><option value=\"Every external auditor\">Every external auditor</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m1-tbs1-f3\">Required response to the omitted interface</label><select id=\"isc-m1-tbs1-f3\"><option value=\"Document the data flow and evaluate its controls\">Document the data flow and evaluate its controls</option><option value=\"Ignore it\">Ignore it</option><option value=\"Assume it cannot affect reporting\">Assume it cannot affect reporting</option><option value=\"Delete the ledger from scope\">Delete the ledger from scope</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m1-tbs1-f4\">Effect of outsourcing on accountability</label><select id=\"isc-m1-tbs1-f4\"><option value=\"It changes control performance but does not eliminate accountability\">It changes control performance but does not eliminate accountability</option><option value=\"It removes every customer duty\">It removes every customer duty</option><option value=\"It guarantees accurate payroll\">It guarantees accurate payroll</option><option value=\"It prevents all security incidents\">It prevents all security incidents</option></select></div></section>",
